ストーリー展開が特徴で、刀剣男士たちが歴史改変を目論む敵と戦う姿を描く。脚本・演出は末満健一が一貫して手掛けている。"}]]}],["$","article","a3",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/a3","children":"A3!"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[2,"作品"]}],null]}],["$","article","naruto",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/naruto","children":"NARUTO"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[2,"作品"]}],null]}],["$","article","haikyu",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/haikyu","children":"ハイキュー!!"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[2,"作品"]}],null]}],["$","article","kingdom",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/kingdom","children":"舞台『キングダム』"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[2,"作品"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"cast-role","children":"原泰久による国民的大ヒットコミック『キングダム』（集英社「週刊ヤングジャンプ」連載）を原作とし、東宝製作により2023年に帝国劇場で初演された歴史スペクタクル舞台シリーズ。戦乱の春秋戦国時代を舞台に、天下の大将軍を夢見る戦災孤児の少年・信と、のちの始皇帝となる若き秦王・嬴政（えいせい）の果てなき闘いを圧倒的なスケール…"}]]}],["$","article","k",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/k","children":"K"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[1,"作品"]}],null]}],["$","article","psychopass",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/psychopass","children":"PSYCHO-PASS"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop":8,"fontSize":13},"children":[1,"作品"]}],null]}],["$","article","enstars",{"className":"cast-card","children":[["$","$L2",null,{"className":"cast-name","href":"/series/enstars","children":"あんさんぶるスターズ！"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"muted","style":{"marginTop"